WEBVTT

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.580
I'd like three croquettes, please!

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:32.250
"Nagafuji Butcher Shop"

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:32.250
Thanks for waiting. Here you go.
That'll be 240 yen.

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:36.500
Hot, hot! Nom.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:41.040
Yum! Om, nom, nom, hot!

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:44.830
Thanks, thanks, thanks for the grub!

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:55.950
W-Wait!

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:00.660
I'm pretty sure I've never had anyone
so blatantly run away from me before.

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.500
It looked like Adachi was trying to say
something but couldn't get it out.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:09.040
Something that Adachi would have
a hard time saying... Is it...?

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:12.540
--Nah, it couldn't be.
--Tweedle deedle dee!

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.950
Swoosh!

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:16.370
Okay!

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:20.160
Sis, let's play some games!

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:21.950
Wait, right now?

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:23.910
Let's do this!

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.950
That person went home really early.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:29.910
Yeah.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:32.830
Did you guys get in a fight?

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.750
I'd like to know that myself.

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:39.200
Should I have played
something like this with Adachi?

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.120
It was bit late to think about that now, but...

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:46.500
I keep having regrets like this,

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:50.290
and I just can't seem to learn from them.

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:55.450
I had started to catch on to my lack
of interest, though only just slightly.

00:01:55.450 --> 00:02:00.290
Sometimes, my fingertips look thin and flimsy.

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:03.330
And when that happens, I never feel great.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.620
What about now, though?

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:11.370
Are my fingers so flimsy
that they'll get nowhere?

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.200
Hey...

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.040
I win!

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:22.370
Jeez, you fall for that so easily.

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.660
Super ultimate... headbutt!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:04.040
"Why did you leave yesterday?"

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.660
Adachi's still not here.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:10.160
"Why did you leave yesterday?"

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:10.160
Is it my fault if she just stops
coming to school all together?

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:11.370
Is it my fault if she just stops
coming to school all together?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:15.290
No... I can't help but feel
like Adachi's basically like a cat

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.200
that got all worked up, climbed up a tree,
and couldn't come back down.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.700
"You good? Or something?"

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:21.700
that got all worked up, climbed up a tree,
and couldn't come back down.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.200
You're weak, Adachi.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.870
Wow, really?

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:28.950
Yeah.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.290
But you know...

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.410
Morning.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.950
Oh, there she is.

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:34.620
We're borrowing your desk.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:36.410
Sure.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:38.290
Adachi's not here, is she?

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.540
Nope. They said she's absent today.

00:04:40.540 --> 00:04:41.870
Really?

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.000
Apparently, she has a cold.

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.790
Ah, so she's skipping.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:49.040
I thought she was skipping
with you in the gym again.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:53.080
It's just me today.
It's not like we're always together.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.500
Oh, really? You guys seemed
pretty much attached at the hip.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:03.580
Really?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:05.910
Shimar, did you eat yet?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.950
Who are you talking to?
Come to think of it...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.620
I guess I haven't eaten yet.

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:13.080
Then you must be starving.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.450
Say, "Ah."

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:18.450
Carrots again? If you hate them so much,
ask them to leave them out.

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:22.790
Crap... I basically like everything here...

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:27.250
Seriously, do you just see me
as a walking garbage disposal?

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:30.950
Nah, don't worry. I love you, Shimamura.

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.040
Oh, joy...

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:37.660
Oh, hey, Nagafuji. You should tell her
about the weird customer you got.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.250
Huh? Did I mention something?

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:44.000
Seriously? You mentioned
a weird, blue-haired girl.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:44.620
So you were lying after all?

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.950
"I'm thinking about stopping by
your place today... You mind??"

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:45.950
So you were lying after all??

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.830
"I'm thinking about stopping by
your place today... You mind??"

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.830
Oh, yeah. That did actually happen.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:55.700
If Adachi is ignoring me,
even I'd be somewhat depressed.

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:58.540
But I'd pretty much be over it
in about three days,

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.950
and basically be fine.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:01.830
"I'm thinking about stopping by
your place today... You mind??"

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.000
"I'm thinking about stopping by
your place today... You mind??"

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:04.000
Even saying that doesn't make me feel bad,

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:05.370
Even saying that doesn't make me feel bad,

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:08.410
but others wouldn't feel great about it,

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:11.330
so I just don't mention it to anyone.

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.500
Hello, there.

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.790
Huh? Who are you?

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.330
Oh? Can you not tell?

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:37.080
Yeah, uh...

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.910
--A moment, please.
--Huh?

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.330
Vroom.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.000
Um...

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:48.160
Wait, what?!

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:52.910
Shukoh... Shukoh...

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.540
So that's what you look like on the inside.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:59.290
I was hoping you'd recognize my voice,
rather than me resorting to this.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:04.040
My face is complete now,
so I thought I'd come find you.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.160
What do you think?

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:09.250
Uh... I wish you wouldn't ask that.

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:12.330
I made it look like an earthling's face.

00:07:12.330 --> 00:07:14.620
Are you making fun of earthlings?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:18.370
So, uh... You gave up on the spacesuit getup?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:25.790
Indeed. I always thought
that's how earthlings dressed,

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.120
but I haven't seen too many wearing them.

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:31.080
Yeah, more like no one.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:35.450
Exactly, so... Whoops.

00:07:37.660 --> 00:07:39.290
--Hngh! Hngh! Hngh! Hngh!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.200
--What are you doing?
--Hngh! Hngh! Hngh! Hngh!

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:44.950
I can't have anyone else hearing this,
so please lend me your ear.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:47.330
Right...

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:50.910
Whisper, whisper, whisper, whisper.
Whisper, whisper, whisper.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.250
No one needed that intro!

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:57.450
But if they find out I'm an alien,
they're going to dissect me.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:02.540
Dissect you? I think your view
of earthlings might be a bit confused.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:07.450
That's why I decided to abandon that outfit,
so I would not stand out anymore.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.870
Sniff, sniff. Sniff, sniff.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.160
H-Hey.

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:12.830
You don't smell as lovely today.

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:13.950
Listen, you...

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.160
Donuts!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:19.290
Donuts, donuts, donuts, donuts,
donuts, donuts, donuts, donuts!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.790
Damn it, let go!

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:24.080
Oooh, nooo!

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.910
Step.

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:29.700
I must say, I feel that fate
has brought us together.

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:31.540
Is that so...?

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:36.540
I believe that you were born to meet me.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:42.330
I was born to meet <i>you</i>?
Wouldn't it usually be the opposite?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:47.000
Oh, no. I have other duties I must do.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.450
Oh? In that case...

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:53.370
Are you trying to say I have
nothing else better to do?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.040
Ish no ushe.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.410
Do you live around here?

00:08:58.410 --> 00:09:02.370
I do not. I was about to procure my dinner.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.120
We will probably meet again.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:13.410
Until next time, bye-bye, butterfly!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:18.870
Coming.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.200
Huh?

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.370
Yo.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.040
Hey!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.450
Give me 15 minutes.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.580
Huh? That's a bit long.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:45.540
Adachi! Save me... Open up.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.660
I can't anymore...

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:53.080
Fifteen minutes... Is she changing?
Fixing her bedhead?

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:56.370
That seems like a lot of work
just to talk to me.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:10:01.790
But I get not wanting to look
so sloppy in front of my friends.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:06.750
Destroying your class image or
having it destroyed is a bit unnerving.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.410
Why are you wearing your uniform?

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.450
It just sorta happened.

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.830
Also...

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:18.160
Where did you even get that elephant T-shirt?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:19.910
Please don't ask...

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.830
Don't just show up. You scared me.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.250
I messaged you.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:27.540
Messaged? Oh...

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.910
So you didn't read them.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:32.040
My phone's in my school bag...

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.580
And, uh... I forgot that at your house.

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:39.540
Oh, so that's why.

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:44.330
I see. Is that also why
you didn't come to school?

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:46.870
Because you didn't have your school bag?

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.750
I-I was just tired.

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:54.660
But it is... sorta your fault, too...

00:10:54.660 --> 00:10:55.580
Huh?

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:59.500
What did you message me?

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:03.040
Oh, just like, "You good?"

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:05.410
Then, yeah, I'm good...

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.830
Do that again.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:09.830
No.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:12.410
So, can I come in now?

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.620
Oh, I have work today...

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:16.700
Oh, I see.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:19.040
Guess I'll go home then.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.410
Well, I have a little time to talk.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:25.500
Hm... Do I have anything to say, though?

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:27.410
Adachi, think of something to talk about.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:28.660
Huh?

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:33.700
Well, uh... um...

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:36.910
Y-You good?

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.750
Ayup...

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:44.080
So I heard you didn't go to school
because of a cold. Are you better now?

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:48.330
My cough suddenly came back...

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:52.700
I'm sure you'd feel awful if I caught it,
so I should head home.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.330
Wait, no. I'm better now.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.540
Okay, Adachi. Next topic.

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.040
Say, Shimamura...

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:16.120
Go... out with...

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:20.040
Did you want to hang out sometime?
Like maybe Saturday?

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.080
Huh?

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:24.700
"Nagafuji Butcher Shop"

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.790
"Nagafuji Butcher Shop"

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.790
Taeko, you can head back in now.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.330
Hey, you're back, Nagafuji...

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:40.620
Seconds, please.

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:43.290
You wish, get out.

00:12:43.290 --> 00:12:46.700
Why is she always at my house?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:51.750
"Taeko Nagafuji"      "Akira Hino"

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.080
Hey, Hino... Come here.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.620
Hm? Are you gonna give me something?

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.330
Yeah, I will.

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:02.790
Ooh, really?!

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:06.080
What is it? Whatcha gonna give me?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.540
Where'd that come from?!

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:28.250
I just remembered that we used
to do that as kids all the time.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.790
I think we used to do that all day.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:36.950
Did we? But that's in the past. Now, it's...

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:38.910
Did something change?

00:13:40.830 --> 00:13:43.040
I guess not.

00:13:43.040 --> 00:13:44.830
Some things never change.

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.000
Sorry, did I keep you...?

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.750
Again...

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:07.040
I just happened by and you were randomly here.

00:14:07.040 --> 00:14:08.410
Huh...?

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:10.080
It's fate, I tell you.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.410
Yeah, sure.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.700
Oh?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.950
You're the girl from the other day...

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:17.200
Hello.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.790
Huh? Who is this?

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.200
Prepare the thing.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.250
Yes, ma'am! A moment, please!

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:25.580
Huh? Wait, wha--?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.540
Huh?

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.410
Shimamura...

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:33.870
Shimamura in her normal clothes...
She's so insanely cute...

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:41.700
Thank you for waiting!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:42.750
Huh?!

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.700
Shukoh...

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:45.750
--Shukoh... Shukoh...

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:48.450
--So, yeah. She's the little alien
from the other day.
--Shukoh... Shukoh...

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.040
Hello.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.700
What do you think?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:03.750
It hides all of your best qualities.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.660
Here.

00:15:04.660 --> 00:15:08.330
Thank you. What is your name?

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:12.200
I'm Adachi. And who... are you?

00:15:12.200 --> 00:15:16.950
To put it simply, I am an alien from the future.

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.950
Shimamura, translate, please.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:25.580
Just think of her as that one
really weird kid from the neighborhood.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:28.450
Is this the friend you were waiting for?

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:29.700
Yeah.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:32.500
Then let us go.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:36.700
I wanted to thank you for the donuts
the other day. My treat.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.410
Wait... You're coming with us?

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.830
Wait, what?

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:52.700
I thought you might make a run for it again.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.620
I-I won't...

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:01.120
Well, let's just see where this goes.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:04.750
Please, Shimamura. Have a seat.

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.830
Huh? Sure.

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.290
Come, come. Come, come.

00:16:09.290 --> 00:16:11.370
Oh, sorry. My bad.

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.250
Hurry, hurry!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:15.620
Okay, okay.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:18.250
What should we get?

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.620
Scooch in a bit.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.200
Huh? Sure... Huh?

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.660
Wait, this isn't how this usually works.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:28.080
I'm going to get this
super fluffy souffle omelet.

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:30.160
What would you like, Shimamura?

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.370
Huh? Um...

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:34.540
This looks good.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.750
Yeah... What are you getting, Adachi?

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:40.500
You can get whatever you'd like.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:42.620
Can I see the menu?

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:44.790
Here. Huh? Wha--?

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.160
What?!

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:48.080
What are you getting, Shimamura?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:52.660
Um... Then why don't we get
a pizza and pasta and split it?

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:53.580
Sure.

00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:54.580
Stab.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.580
Hey!

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.500
I was bored...

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:05.450
Do you often poke people
in their vital points when you're bored?

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:07.750
Do you?

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:12.910
Shimamura, choose a pizza. I'll choose a pasta.

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:14.410
Adachi...

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:18.200
What's wrong?

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.750
N-Nofing...

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:24.080
Then do that one thing. With a smile.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:26.450
What? What thing?

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:29.080
From the other day. Okay, here we go.

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:31.000
You good?

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:34.620
You good?

00:17:35.660 --> 00:17:38.910
I-I'm good!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:45.790
Yay, the feast has arrived!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:47.580
Glob...

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:57.620
Ooh! It's all sizzly! So sizzly!

00:17:57.620 --> 00:17:59.450
Let me have a bite of that.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.500
Sure!

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:02.910
Here you go.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.950
Something wrong?

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.040
No...

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:10.080
Hurry up, please. My hand will fall off.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:14.330
Okay, okay. But really,
why are you talking like that?

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:21.830
That's so sweet!
That's way too much syrup.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:22.870
You think so?

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.160
Gyah!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:30.040
Adachi... Could you not grab at my pudge?

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.830
Oh, right.

00:18:34.540 --> 00:18:36.450
You can have a bite of mine, too.

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.870
Huh?

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.290
Weren't we splitting it, anyway?

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:41.580
Yeah, but...

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.500
Um... You get an extra bite.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.660
Well, if you insist.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.250
Yummy!

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:56.700
May I go first?

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.080
Sure...

00:18:59.080 --> 00:19:01.290
I have a great idea.

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.870
Yeah, yeah.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:08.700
Don't run away.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.660
I-I won't run away!

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:12.080
Good.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.540
You're really good at taking care of others.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:21.450
I'm used to dealing with scuttly ones like her
since I have a little sister.

00:19:21.450 --> 00:19:24.660
Am I your little sister, too?

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:28.000
You can call me Big Sis anytime.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.700
Big Sis...

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:38.580
Wh-What is it, little one?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.790
Shimamura, behind you.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.080
What?!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.160
Ready, and...

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.000
Hey, wait! What do you think you're doing?!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:56.120
I figured it out. It's only difficult
because the pins are so far away.

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:57.290
Wha...?

00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.910
It's easier from here.

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:02.330
Wow, you're so smart.

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:07.040
By the way, what's the prize if I win this?

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:14.080
Huh? Well, doesn't it give you the sweet
satisfaction of, "Sweet! I beat them!"?

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:19.330
Well, that'd be no fun
because I like you, Shimamura.

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:22.080
I like you, I like you, I like you...

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:24.830
Like?

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:28.250
Oh, really? Thanks, I guess.

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.660
In that case...

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:33.000
Want to go up against me?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:33.910
Huh?!

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:35.160
Oho...

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:39.250
You think you have a chance
against me, a pro bowlinger?

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:42.160
Of course, I'm going to win.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:43.660
And when I win...

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:44.870
Adachi?

00:20:44.870 --> 00:20:46.500
Come closer.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.950
Whisper, whisper...

00:20:48.950 --> 00:20:50.580
Whisper, whisper, whisper...

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.040
Oho...

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.120
Nope.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:07.410
Hiyah! Hurgh...

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:14.410
I did it!

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:18.330
You may steal that move, if you'd like.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.200
I'm pretty sure throwing it
normally will work just fine.

00:21:21.200 --> 00:21:23.830
Hey, are you okay?

00:21:23.830 --> 00:21:25.700
I'm perfectly fine.

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:29.040
Did you scrape a knee or anything?

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:32.410
Who are you cheering for, Shimamura?

00:21:32.410 --> 00:21:33.410
Wait, what?

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.160
Well, who is it?

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:36.410
Really?

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:39.830
Shimamura!

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:50.040
I wish you wouldn't ask me that.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.830
There's no way you wouldn't be
tired doing this...

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:58.950
I feel like I'm slowly being
chipped at and wearing away...

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:01.830
But I get bored being alone.

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:06.580
That's somehow a far worse and
unbearable condition than being alone.

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:10.830
And the remedy for that
must be something created

00:22:10.830 --> 00:22:13.660
"If things don't go well and I end up
hurting you a lot, please don't hate me."
with others that our eyes can't see.

00:22:13.660 --> 00:22:17.370
That's why I'm going to continue wearing away.

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:21.580
I'll keep losing pieces of myself
in order to keep myself afloat.

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:22.950
"Episode 3: 'Isosceles Triangle'"

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:28.080
"Episode 3: 'Isosceles Triangle'"

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:28.080
If things don't go well and I end
up hurting you a lot, please don't hate me...

00:23:58.040 --> 00:23:58.450
"Next Time: 'High School Girls On Holiday'"

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.750
"Next Time: 'High School Girls On Holiday'"

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:00.750
Adashimapedia: Bowling!

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:02.450
"Next Time: 'High School Girls On Holiday'"

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:02.450
Woo-hoo, I got a strike!

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:03.500
"Next Time: 'High School Girls On Holiday'"

00:24:02.450 --> 00:24:03.500
Yeah!

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:05.410
Wait, why are we high-fiving?

00:24:05.410 --> 00:24:06.700
Especially since
we're playing against each other.

00:24:06.700 --> 00:24:08.200
Woo-hoo, I got a strike!

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:09.700
I'm not going to lose!

00:24:09.700 --> 00:24:11.410
Bring it!

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:13.080
--This is it.
--It sure is.
